From d0f3593c1ee49eee1a3745b6ef3112068423c434 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Olivier Louvignes <olivier@mgcrea.io>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 07:39:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 14/16] iio: adc: add the Ingenic X1600 ADC

The X1600's SAR ADC has four auxiliary channels, each with its own start
bit, interrupt flag and 12-bit result, and none of the touchscreen or
battery engines of the JZ47xx ADCs that ingenic-adc drives. Add a small
driver that exposes the four channels as voltages against the 3.3 V
reference.

The register layout and clock dividers come from the vendor 4.4 kernel;
on a HiBy R1 the channels carry the buttons, the headphone jack and the
headset remote.
---
